From: Andreas Baierl <ichgeh@imkreisrum.de>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 10:50:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] device: log lost and damaged video ts packets

VDR drops the PES of a TS packet with the transport error indicator
set, but passes a PES with lost packets on. Such an incomplete access
unit may hang a hardware decoder.

Check the continuity counter, the transport error indicator and the
scrambling of the video TS packets and log the errors with the new
debug log category for TS errors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
